From b6c767387b22cf1c3b01c256f32ca4b4e55ecb61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hank Yeomans <hank@quorra.ah.local>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:48:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 29/50] T3.16j: remove the B2 direct-UVA residue (ledger G2)

Delete KT_B2_UVA_EXPERTS / KT_B2_MAX_TOKENS, remap_topk_ids_for_b2, _uva_view,
_B2HostPool, _B2UvaExperts (run/fork/join), the use_b2 branch and b2_out join
in apply, the B2 block in process_weights_after_loading, submit()'s
num_kt_experts parameter, check_moe_topology's b2_experts/has_streamer, and
KtRuntime.side_stream. B2 was rejected at E30 (recipe evidence/t318-b2-prototype/);
no T3.20 design note names the stream/UVA primitives, so they go too (G2 rule).
Gate: consistency PASS bs 1..4, C1 39.21 wall, C4 53.93 wall, NLL 0/65,653 moved
(recipe evidence/t316j/).

Amp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a0c10b-a5f8-77fc-b238-7147d12ccf29
Co-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>
